img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742830/extras/515148fc1727a5ef9c98c96446be4443.poster.avif?t=1782460627\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742830/extras/515148fc1727a5ef9c98c96446be4443.webm?t=1782460627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742830/extras/515148fc1727a5ef9c98c96446be4443.mp4?t=1782460627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer requires at least one controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard and mouse are supported for single-player gameplay.</p>", "short_description": "The Awakener: Battle Tendency fuses Diablo-style build depth with Dynasty Warriors crowd-clearing. In 20–50 intense hours, shred monster hordes and craft your own style with hundreds of affixes and talents—no filler, just kill, loot, grow.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742830/a629087934f370581a962797e2a12c99813a6a00/header.jpg?t=1782460627", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742830/21b3c9ef7740e95ea30203a3067d248438476b2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782460627", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742830/21b3c9ef7740e95ea30203a3067d248438476b2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782460627", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I5-8400 / AMD RYZEN 3 3300X<br></li>